l, notes: [...]}, … top-k ],
  diagnostics: {A(n) spectrum, Fisher p, radial profile, Bessel corr vs m,
                phase coherence C, nodal residual ε_node, noise floor τ}
}
```

The decoder never collapses to one mode silently; uniqueness claims are only ever made at
the level of *frequency-ratio clusters* under a stated Q and resolution.

